        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "An order to attend court addressed to a person confined in prison"

-- src:1438 | (12) The order to attend court in paragraph (11) may be served on the Superintendent of the prison by ordinary service and must be served at least 14 days before the hearing.
