        IF `the date of service` AT MOST `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must be served at least 14 days before the hearing" (a period the text fixes in its own words, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))

@ref O 15 r 4(12) (src:1438)
