        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The order to attend court in paragraph (11) may be served on the Superintendent of the prison by ordinary service"

-- src:1439 | (13) A witness, who is not a party, who has not given his or her evidence must remain outside the courtroom until he or she is called into Court.
